{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDIwL0ZyYW5rJTIwWmVkJTIwJTI4MjAyMCUyOS8","type":"movie","name":"Frank Zed","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/xS9n3JuaVup4dBzUw6sjZOMezMz.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3WRB8hrXnRboNacLEMvTTsw2sSG.jpg","description":"Featuring an all-puppet cast, Frank and Zed tells the story of a doomed village, whose King made a fateful deal to stop a demon from destroying the village years before. Now, as the prophecy comes true upon the King’s death, the villagers brace for an orgy of blood. Living in a destroyed castle not far from the village are Frank and Zed, a Frankenstein-type monster and his brain-eating companion. As the villagers prepare for their impending doom, the two monsters are pulled into a war of epic, puppet-mutilating proportions. This debut feature film by Jesse Blanchard is a hilarious tale of misguided fears, innocent brain consumption, and a loving friendship.\n\nReleased 8 Mar 2020 · United States of America · Language: English · 90 min\nStudio: Puppetcore Films\n\nOn your server — Audio: English","releaseInfo":"2020","genres":["Animation","Horror","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"7.2","imdb_id":"tt7374030","moviedb_id":674821,"tmdbId":674821,"runtime":"90 min","cast":["Sam A. Mowry","Jerry Bell Jr.","Aaron Booth","Randolph F. Christen","Chris Henry","Johnny Huang","Brian McKann","Jonathan McLain"],"director":["Jesse Blanchard"],"writer":["Jesse Blanchard"],"released":"2020-03-08T00:00:00.000Z","country":"United States of America","language":"English","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Jesse Blanchard","character":"Director"},{"name":"Sam A. Mowry","character":"Narrator"},{"name":"Jerry Bell Jr.","character":"Ibn","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/uctCdo7V55oa5wkiTGC2np6sF7B.jpg"},{"name":"Aaron Booth","character":"Shadowbooth"},{"name":"Randolph F. Christen","character":"The Priest"},{"name":"Chris Henry","character":"The Baker"},{"name":"Johnny Huan